---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const title = "Credit Card Balance Transfer Timeline (Payoff target)";
const description =
  "Set a payoff target for balance transfers so the balance clears before the promo ends. Educational use only.";
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonicalPath="/guides/balance-transfer-payoff-timeline">
  <section class="card hero">
    <span class="pill">Guide</span>
    <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <a href="/guides">Guides</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span aria-current="page">Balance transfer timeline</span>
    </nav>
    <h1>Balance transfer payoff timeline</h1>
    <p>
      Set a payment target that clears your balance before the promo ends. This guide shows how to build the timeline and
      avoid a costly post-promo APR.
    </p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/calculators/credit-card-payoff-calculator">Credit card payoff calculator</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/guides/0-apr-credit-card-payoff-plan">0% APR payoff plan</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/topics/credit-cards">Credit cards topic</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card section prose" style="margin-top:18px">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0">Build the timeline</h2>
    <ol class="muted" style="margin:10px 0 0; padding-left:18px">
      <li>Divide the balance by promo months to get a minimum target.</li>
      <li>Increase the payment if there is a transfer fee.</li>
      <li>Track progress monthly and adjust early if you fall behind.</li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="card section prose" style="margin-top:18px">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0">Inputs to include</h2>
    <ul class="muted" style="margin:10px 0 0; padding-left:18px">
      <li>Balance transfer fee added to the starting balance.</li>
      <li>Promo APR end date and any deferred interest rules.</li>
      <li>Minimum payment requirement during the promo.</li>
      <li>Monthly payment you can sustain without new charges.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="card section prose" style="margin-top:18px">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0">Why timing matters</h2>
    <p class="muted" style="margin:10px 0 0">
      Missing the promo end date can add a high APR to any remaining balance. A small buffer payment can prevent a large
      increase in interest costs.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="card section prose" style="margin-top:18px">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0">Common mistakes</h2>
    <ul class="muted" style="margin:10px 0 0; padding-left:18px">
      <li>Forgetting to include the balance transfer fee.</li>
      <li>Assuming minimum payments will clear the balance in time.</li>
      <li>Adding new purchases to the transfer card.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="grid" style="margin-top:18px">
    <div class="card section prose col-6">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0">Related tools</h2>
      <ul class="muted" style="margin:10px 0 0; padding-left:18px">
        <li><a href="/calculators/credit-card-payoff-calculator">Credit card payoff</a></li>
        <li><a href="/calculators/minimum-payment-payoff-calculator">Minimum payment payoff</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card section prose col-6">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0">Related guides</h2>
      <ul class="muted" style="margin:10px 0 0; padding-left:18px">
        <li><a href="/guides/credit-card-balance-transfer-fee">Balance transfer fee vs savings</a></li>
        <li><a href="/guides/credit-card-penalty-apr">Penalty APR explained</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card section prose" style="margin-top:18px">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0">FAQ</h2>
    <h3 style="margin:12px 0 0">Is it okay to pay more than the target?</h3>
    <p class="muted" style="margin:8px 0 0">
      Yes. Paying more shortens the payoff and lowers risk of missing the promo end date.
    </p>
    <h3 style="margin:12px 0 0">Should I set autopay?</h3>
    <p class="muted" style="margin:8px 0 0">
      Autopay helps avoid late payments that can end the promo. Just ensure the payment amount is sufficient.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="card section prose" style="margin-top:18px">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0">Next steps</h2>
    <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:10px">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/calculators/credit-card-payoff-calculator">Build the payoff plan</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/guides/credit-card-balance-transfer-fee">Balance transfer fee guide</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/topics/credit-cards">Credit cards topic</a>
    </div>
    <p class="muted" style="margin:12px 0 0">Educational use only. Not financial advice.</p>
    <p class="muted" style="margin:12px 0 0; font-size:13px">Last updated: 2026-01-31</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
